  <!-- The town smithy: the Wayfarers post a factor in every friendly town,
       and every town of any size has a forge. Stamped beside the guild
       house by MapComponent_TSC_GuildFactor; the smith works at the anvil
       inside and trades in SILVER (TSC_Trader_Smith - the same stock the
       village smith carries). -->
